-- Newest wording for "What is Camp Yalla?" (from Yalla); a saved Admin copy gets it too.
UPDATE "faq_entries" SET "answer" = $faq$Camp Yalla is our play-based camp for children ages 18 months to 10 years, offered on select days when local schools and childcare programs are closed. We follow a daily rhythm that gives children a sense of what comes next and plenty of time to decide what they’d like to do. They might build a fort with a friend, head out on a make-believe adventure, or spend the morning making mud pies in the play garden. We come together for stories, morning and afternoon snack, and lunch. We provide both snacks, and families pack lunch.

Camp runs from 9:00 am to 3:00 pm, with Early Bird care from 8:00 am and the option to stay until 4:30 pm. Book the days that work for your family.

[See upcoming camp dates →](/programs/camp-yalla#dates)$faq$ WHERE "id" = 'what-is-camp';
